<title>UK: Bunzl buys U.S. bonded fibres business.</title>
<headline>Bunzl buys U.S. bonded fibres business.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>British-based paper and plastics group Bunzl Plc said on Thursday that it has agreed to buy the bonded fibres business of American Filtrona Corp for $72.45 million in cash.</p>
</text>
